        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>DWD-SD-86458, Urban Hexagon Shower Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Hexagon Shower Door Knobset comes packaged with 2 shower door knobs and a mounting kit for a 1/4 inch to 1/2 inch thick glass shower door. This Urban Hexagon Shower Handle is available in several modern finishes, for contemporary or transitional styled bathrooms.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DWD-SD-86458-specifications.gif?v=1704354637\" width=\"476\" height=\"157\" border=\"0\" atl=\"Emtek 86458 specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the SD-86458 Hexagon Shower Knob Pair:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Base Diameter: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1/4\" - 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged with 2 knobs and includes all the hardware for back to back mounting (2 knobs bolt to each other through the shower door) on a 1/2\" thick glass shower door.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-modern-5-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354501\" width=\"511\" height=\"111\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold as a Pair - 2 Shower Door Knobs (1 knob for each side of the glass)</i>\r\n</p>",
