                "title": "Hexagon Shower Door Knobset",
                "description": "The Hexagon Shower Door Knobset comes packaged with 2 shower door knobs and a mounting kit for a 1/4 inch to 1/2 inch thick glass shower door. This Urban Hexagon Shower Handle is available in several modern finishes, for contemporary or transitional styled bathrooms.\r\n",
